@c We use @andkey, etc to escape & from TeX in lambda lists --
@c so we need to define them for info as well.
@macro andallowotherkeys
&allow-other-keys
@end macro
@macro andoptional
&optional
@end macro
@macro andrest
&rest
@end macro
@macro andkey
&key
@end macro
@macro andbody
&body
@end macro

